WEBVTT

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.330
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRRRR-
RRRRRRRGGGGGHHHHHHHHHHH!!

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.930
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.780
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:52.440
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:57.910
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:01.450
<i>I could place all the blame on you,</i>

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.200
<i>swallowing back my tears,</i>

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:09.040
<i>but I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.260
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.550
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.500
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.730
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.220
<i>(To the ends)</i>

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:18.100
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:19.840
<i>(Of time)</i>

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.640
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.560
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.660
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.820
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.570
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:39.160
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.790
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.790
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:50.220
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:56.930
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.070
Good morning, Messer.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.350
How is your wound?

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:13.860
Just fine. I'll be back on the job by tomorrow.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.860
I've lost count of how many times you've saved us.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.730
It's my duty.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:24.020
Still. Thank you so much.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:25.980
You're welcome.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:33.750
Since then, the military stopped 
importing Windermerean galaxy apples

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:37.260
and using water from the ruins.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:42.890
When they tried to track down the suppliers, 
they found nothing but dummy corporations.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.150
Furthermore, research has revealed

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:52.410
that the seidznole produced by the reaction between the water and those apples

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:56.000
aids the growth of fold bacteria and thus accelerates the spread of Var.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:01.120
The Var Syndrome is likely caused by such fold bacteria infecting the cells responsible for

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:05.370
emitting and amplifying powerful emotions by means of subspace,

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.870
resulting in turning people into a violent mob.

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:18.590
All members of Walküre have been selected 
because we possess so-called fold receptors,

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.610
which are capable of suppressing the activity of fold bacteria.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:24.050
Huh? Me too?

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.210
That's right. You included.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:30.690
That's how we are capable of calming the Var.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.820
Walküre auditions are how we try to find people who possess fold receptors.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.390
Hayate Immelmann.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.410
You are also one such person.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.680
Hayate's one?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.700
Sorry.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.910
I never found a good time to break it to you until now.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.160
During the battle on Voldor,

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.560
Hayate's receptor values skyrocketed.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.510
Looks like you and Freyja resonate with each other.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.010
Hayate and me?

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.930
Resonate, huh?

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.310
Hold on.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:15.310
If people with fold receptors are less prone to the Var,

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.420
then what about us who don't have them?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.030
You have the songs.

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:23.530
As long as you're directly listening 
to my song, you'll be safe.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:28.160
What about the people who've 
already been infected by the Var?

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.110
There's no perfect treatment yet.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:35.920
They might also be affected by 
Windermere's song of the wind.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:51.080
Two years ago, the Var wiped out a planet called Alfheim.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:55.080
I heard you're from the town of Marienburg but survived.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:59.020
Cpt. Arad saved you from the verge of death, supposedly.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.730
Could it be you were infected there already?

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:08.190
Should I tell the captain then 
about what happened to you?

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.340
You are correct.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:11.200
I've turned Var once before.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.830
The captain knows that.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.210
He does?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.210
All he talks about is jellyfish.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.250
Does he also know you're showing symptoms again?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.090
What are you gonna do?

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.940
Return to service.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.960
But you can't!

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.220
Enough. Return to base.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.620
Lieutenant!

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:37.230
Let's go. He ain't gonna listen.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.670
Don't touch that!

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.700
Is that Walküre?

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.220
I've never heard this song.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.760
This is Kaname's voice.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:14.990
Don't tell anyone about me.

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:16.090
But...

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.240
Please.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:22.650
First Lt. Messer...

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.720
What do we do?

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.830
Good question.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:37.130
Another year without a hot date to take me to the jellyfish festival.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.030
Look at that!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.380
Huh? Haya-Haya and Mira-Mira?

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:48.300
Ah, wistfully gazing into the 
sunset together, words unneeded!

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:52.820
I heard Hayate brought her into his room at Ragnyanyan before.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.160
His room?!

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.970
Maria's intel has never been wrong!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.880
Did they then...

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.270
What? What do you mean?

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:01.770
Lovers living separately.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.350
L-L-L-Lovers?!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:19.970
I'm back.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:21.370
Oh, welcome back!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.790
Where's Kaname?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.880
She's not back yet.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:24.880
Oh.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.270
Um!

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.020
Yeah...

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.090
Good night!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.890
But it's only 8pm...

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:38.910
I'm back.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.940
Hey, welcome back.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:44.180
This feels good.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.360
What is it?

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:52.360
You're the one who sings Axia, right?

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.680
Ah. That's before when Mikumo joined.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.830
I was the lead vocalist back then.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:06.540
You know, before I joined Walküre, I had a short career as an idol.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.950
Solo.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:12.120
But things didn't work out and I retired.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.550
Even then, I couldn't give up on my dream and kept trying to make something happen.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.770
Then my fold receptors got me into Walküre.

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:25.500
That's the last song we recorded with me as the lead vocalist of Walküre.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.910
The last?

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:30.470
Yes. Now, Mikumo's the face of Walküre.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:33.120
There's Freyja too.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.410
I don't have the talent to be in the center.

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:44.210
Might be weird to say so myself, but apparently I'm good at dragging people along as their leader.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.250
I see.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:46.670
Yup.

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:15.450
<i>but it looks like I got too close</i>

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:20.740
<i>to the depth of your heart, and I can't hear your song</i>

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:29.450
<i>Oh my love, where are you now?</i>

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:32.510
Argol Petra, the Protoculture ruins on this planet, didn't react to our singing.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:38.210
<i>The sky is gray and I'm lost without you.</i>

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.010
But those on Voldor did.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:37.470
Yes.

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:42.390
Protoculture ruins can be found on a number of occupied planets.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:47.060
<i>There's no wind to carry me far and high</i>

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:47.540
All of them have energy shafts toward the planets' cores.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:56.400
<i>The sky I can't see is ripping my wings off</i>

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:53.090
Then again, we know nothing of how they work or are related to songs.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.960
Messer!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.790
Messer, are you all better?

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:07.540
First Lt. Messer Ihlefeld, reporting for duty.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.180
We can't even hit him when it's three against one?!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.030
I think I know what this is about!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:30.520
Messer's using us to train for the White Knight.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.960
He wants to fight him again.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.410
Dammit!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:59.190
Delta 3, 4, and 5 have been taken down.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:01.300
Quite a sad show.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.390
Your point?

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.870
The real war is only about to begin.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:10.390
Should a commander not worry about his forces' ability?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.070
Lovers... Just the two...

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.460
The two of them...

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.120
Wait, is that Hayate and Mirage?!

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:28.760
They really are alone together!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.750
Ahhhhh!!!!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:40.070
For what reason would Messer go so far?

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:43.680
Whatever it may be, we should stop him.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.720
Easier said than done.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:47.790
What's wrong?

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.520
Sorry.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.320
I'm so pathetic.

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:53.340
We should be worried about the lieutenant,

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:55.440
but I'm concerned about myself too.

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:58.800
I have no fold receptors.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:01.550
I might turn Var anytime.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.360
We've got Freyja.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.100
As long as she sings, we're safe.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.120
That's right.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:18.800
As long as she... As long as Walküre sings.

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.300
No need to worry.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:30.430
We've supplied them with more than enough apples and water already.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.730
They found out about the ruins too.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:37.360
So what? Without the Wind Singer, they're just rocks.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.360
Where are you going?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.780
To investigate.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.950
We're short on time.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.770
Don't worry.

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.700
The song of the wind won't be necessary.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:11.460
What was that wind I felt there?

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.350
What's this feeling?

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.290
My rune is so restless.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.820
We should talk to the captain about this.

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:34.870
I can't let that happen.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.930
So you're gonna keep flying in your condition?

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.150
I have yet to deal with the White Knight.

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:43.530
So you're saying we're not 
good enough to take him down?

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:47.130
You might fall under enemy control!

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:49.550
If that happens, kill me.

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:51.680
Why does it have to come to that?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.430
I ordered you to kill the enemy without failure.

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:58.400
And I'm saying that you 
shouldn't let it get to that point!

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:02.300
Is this about Kaname?

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.400
Now where did that come from?!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:09.760
That bracelet only has that one song by Kaname.

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:17.540
That song...

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.820
That voice is what saved me...

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.150
when I ran amok.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.050
It returned me to my senses.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.720
Then...

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.850
Is this about repaying that debt?!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.390
Air-raid alert?!

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:43.020
Freyja?!

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:45.250
What are you doing here?!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.560
Um...

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:49.990
Look!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:51.990
The Aerial Knights!

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.640
They apparently de-folded inside our air defense space.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:57.820
What about the song of the wind?

00:14:57.820 --> 00:15:01.040
No readings. No Var reports so far either.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.930
So we gotta deal with them without Hemera.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.300
Just you watch, Walküre and Delta Platoon!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.310
The Aerial Knights have arrived!

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:18.270
You're laying it thick, Bogue.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.050
Delta Platoon ready to launch.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.490
I repeat. Delta Platoon ready to launch.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.800
They're taunting us.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:25.940
What awful timing.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.070
Lieutenant...

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.330
Delta Platoon, take off!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.460
The song of the wind is yet to be heard.

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.180
We should stand by here.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:56.850
Trying to steal my stage? They've sure got the guts.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.040
Focus, focus!

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:04.020
White Knight.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.270
Grim Reaper.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.870
So persistent!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.250
Thanks, Delta 5!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.730
Found you, earthling!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:30.130
I'll paint this sky red with your blood!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.230
Delta 5, I'll cover you!

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:35.760
Thanks!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.030
Let's do this, Mirage!

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:37.720
Roger!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.840
They're so into it.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:47.060
Now then, where are the ruins?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.330
Oh?

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:04.010
Delta 3, enemy at seven o'clock above you!

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.100
Aye, sir!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.650
Delta 5, keep running!

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.560
Okay!

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:13.010
Lieutenant!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.010
Messer!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.260
What's wrong, Messer?!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:17.760
Oh, shit.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.200
Commander, requesting Walküre deployment!

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.290
What's wrong?

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.600
Hurry! It's Messer!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.980
Did something happen to Messer?

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:29.650
We're doing this, Walküre!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.080
Roger!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.040
Amusing.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:54.550
<i>If you can see where the sky ends</i>

00:17:54.550 --> 00:18:01.080
<i>If you can hear my voice shaking</i>

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:07.120
<i>Come and dance until you fall apart</i>

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:13.190
<i>Shredded memories will give you limitless wings</i>

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:19.440
<i>How we talked that day... How we'd always laugh...</i>

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:25.330
<i>Just keep standing up until the day of rebirth comes</i>

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:31.000
<i>Break me, come, come now, and feel me more</i>

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.960
<i>Are you, are you there?</i>

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.960
First Lt. Messer! First Lt. Messer!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:39.180
<i>Let us blaze through the battlefield we live</i>

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:43.390
<i>Kill me now, if I'm, if I'm to fall anyway</i>

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:44.140
First Lt. Messer! Do you copy? First Lt. Messer!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:46.140
<i>Or live, live and see the end of destruction</i>

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:50.270
<i>Call on a miracle</i>

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:54.780
<i>Draw its light to the closed skies</i>

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.740
He dodged it.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.620
Take this!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.330
Respond, Delta 2!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:03.280
<i>Among all these swirling sensations</i>

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.200
First Lt. Messer!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.280
Shut your fucking traps!

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:09.330
<i>I'm afraid I'll lose sight of my very self</i>

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.360
Oh, crap!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:07.830
Let's go!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.550
Drown in blood!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:15.340
<i>Under the concentrated fire of anxiety</i>

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:21.590
<i>Only the strength to be weak prevails</i>

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.590
Hayate!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.290
Shit.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.600
<i>If it wasn't me</i>

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.600
<i>If it wasn't you</i>

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:34.010
<i>We would've never known how good this feels</i>

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.610
Kaname...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:39.570
<i>Shred your way, your way into the darkness</i>

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.620
<i>Run, run until you turn into ashes</i>

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:43.800
Analysis complete.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:47.490
<i>Then you can fall and scream, scream</i>

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.320
The ruins are intact.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.490
We can make the wind blow anytime!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:51.720
<i>Cut your way through to the star where I'll be born</i>

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.710
Copy that. Good news.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.330
Enemy reinforcements?

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:54.580
<i>Because, because if you'll be there for me</i>

00:19:54.580 --> 00:20:03.720
<i>Together, our light will become invincible</i>

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.800
The tide's turning.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.240
All units return to the Branch!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:15.650
It's been a while since my rune last shone this color.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.220
You're at your limit.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:31.450
I am.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.130
You knew?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:39.660
Lady M agreed to it on the condition

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:42.840
that we give her his data regularly.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.760
That's insane.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.930
I agree.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:56.520
You two were trying to help Messer?

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.610
Sorry we kept it secret.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.710
I should be the one apologizing here.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.320
Huh? Why?

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.190
I need to get some fresh air.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.080
What's wrong with her?

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:18.380
Yikes!

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:22.590
You're loud.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.800
M-Messer?

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.260
Is something wrong?

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.570
No, it's fine.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.480
I just embarrassed myself so much I couldn't take it.

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.150
I see.

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:42.160
I heard Windermereans only live 30 or so years.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:45.650
Don't you ever worry about your future?

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.250
I've never thought about it.

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:54.330
I'm too busy with the present to 
even think about what's to come.

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:59.210
Too busy with the present, huh?

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:02.860
That might work, actually.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:06.680
Mission 09: Uncontrolled on the Edge

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:08.520
Are you ready?

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>I heard a rumor that the world's gonna end someday</i>

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:32.210
<i>Just kidding, it's obviously a lie</i>

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:37.550
<i>I remember looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:37.550 --> 00:22:41.260
<i>and feeling like I was in the future</i>

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:46.860
<i>I felt completely in sync with your wind</i>

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:55.860
<i>You make me truly feel like a girl</i>

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:03.360
<i>so I've got no choice but to do it. I can't stop now!</i>

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:04.950
You better be ready!

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>If my rune shines with a flash</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:12.290
<i>wow woh wow woh</i>

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:15.780
<i>I fall in love</i>

00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:19.250
<i>wow woh wow woh</i>

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:24.800
<i>Lalali lalala you make me</i>

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>Lalala rune pika invincible</i>

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time: Axia Flash

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:39.630
